  ['#projects .project-section-title','研究 <em>项目</em>','Research <em>Project</em>',true],
  ['#catalysis-project-title','催化文献智能数据引擎','Catalysis Literature Intelligence Engine'],
  ['#projects .project-lead','从 PDF 催化文献中提取可追溯的字段级证据和实验记录候选，帮助科研人员快速比较原料、催化剂、反应条件与性能结果。','Extracting traceable, field-level evidence and candidate experimental records from catalysis PDFs to help researchers compare feedstocks, catalysts, conditions, and yields.'],
  ['#projects .showcase-fallback strong','动态演示暂时无法加载','Interactive demo unavailable'],
  ['#projects .showcase-fallback span','下方仍可查看项目流程、成果与学术说明。','See the pipeline architecture, metrics, and academic notes below.'],
  ['#projects .evidence-flow span:nth-of-type(1)','PDF 文献','PDF Corpus'],
  ['#projects .evidence-flow span:nth-of-type(2)','内容切分','Chunking'],
  ['#projects .evidence-flow span:nth-of-type(3)','字段证据检索','Field Evidence Retrieval'],
  ['#projects .evidence-flow span:nth-of-type(4)','数值与对象抽取','Entity & Value Extraction'],
  ['#projects .evidence-flow span:nth-of-type(5)','化学质量校验','Chemical Validation'],
  ['#projects .evidence-flow span:nth-of-type(6)','候选记录与审计输出','Candidate Records & Audit'],
  ['#projects .capability-grid article:nth-child(1) h4','字段级证据检索','Field-Level Evidence Retrieval'],
  ['#projects .capability-grid article:nth-child(1) p','对催化剂、反应条件和性能字段分别检索证据，保留原文与页码，不让模型脱离上下文猜测答案。','Retrieves targeted evidence snippets with exact quotes and page numbers for catalysts, conditions, and yields, preventing ungrounded LLM hallucination.'],
  ['#projects .capability-grid article:nth-child(2) h4','化学兼容性与质量校验','Chemical Compatibility & Validation'],
  ['#projects .capability-grid article:nth-child(2) p','利用对象关系、单位范围与催化化学规则过滤参考文献污染、裸 Y 催化剂和异常温度等高风险结果。','Applies entity-relation constraints, unit bounds, and domain rules to filter reference contamination, bare-Y zeolite ambiguity, and out-of-range temperatures.'],
  ['#projects .capability-grid article:nth-child(3) h4','可追溯结构化输出','Traceable Structured Output'],
  ['#projects .capability-grid article:nth-child(3) p','构建实验记录候选，并同步输出 Excel 与 audit JSON，支持人工逐条回看证据和审计路径。','Builds candidate experimental records and exports both Excel workbooks and audit JSONs for line-by-line human verification.'],
  ['#projects .project-results div:nth-child(1) span','份源 PDF','Source PDFs'],
  ['#projects .project-results div:nth-child(2) span','篇去重论文','Deduplicated Papers'],
  ['#projects .project-results div:nth-child(3) span','条 v2.1 精炼候选记录','v2.1 Refined Candidate Records'],
  ['#projects .project-results div:nth-child(4) span','保留证据与审计路径','Evidence & Audit Traceability'],
  ['#projects .project-notes > div .note-label','Scientific Value · 科学价值','Scientific Value'],
  ['#projects .project-notes > div p','当前文献证据显示，中孔 MFI / H-ZSM-5 体系更常见于 C4-C8 产物；通向 C10-C16 航空燃料馏分仍受扩散、二次裂化、积炭和实验关系数据不足等限制。后续将重点比较 FAU、BEA、分级孔、介孔材料及金属-酸协同体系。','Literature evidence shows medium-pore MFI / H-ZSM-5 systems predominantly yield C4–C8 products, while C10–C16 jet-fuel range selectivity remains constrained by diffusion, secondary cracking, and coking. Next steps compare FAU, BEA, hierarchical/mesoporous zeolites, and metal–acid bifunctional systems.'],
  ['#projects .project-notes > aside .note-label','Academic Note · 学术声明','Academic Note'],
  ['#projects .project-notes > aside p','当前输出定位为<strong>可追溯的科研文献实验数据候选抽取与人工辅助分析系统</strong>。288 条为候选记录，仍需结合论文全文人工复核，不代表完全无人复核的最终数据库，也不构成对最终 SAF 工业催化剂的结论。','Positioned as a <strong>traceable candidate extraction and human-assisted literature analysis system</strong>. The 288 records are candidates requiring full-text review rather than an unverified final database or definitive industrial SAF catalyst claim.',true],
